app.get(/a/, (req, res) => {
  res.send('/a/')
})
```

This route path will match `butterfly` and `dragonfly`, but not `butterflyman`, `dragonflyman`, and so on.

```js
app.get(/.*fly$/, (req, res) => {
  res.send('/.*fly$/')
})
```

